WEBVTT

00:01:29.990 --> 00:01:34.990
Suigin's New Journey!

00:01:35.420 --> 00:01:40.740
Takeshi from the intruder team's 
hammer goes after Viking!

00:01:41.180 --> 00:01:44.260
If it's for Nee-chan...

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:03.050
This is rather unexpected!

00:02:03.050 --> 00:02:04.060
For some reason the intruder team

00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:08.590
have inexplicably begun 
attacking each other!

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:12.710
Could this be some sort of strategy?

00:02:13.790 --> 00:02:15.700
I haven't the slightest...

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:20.990
But I think I've seen that 
girl somewhere before...

00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:23.950
You can do it, Viking!

00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:26.210
What's this? Looks like Mammoth Viking is now

00:02:26.210 --> 00:02:31.760
in a performance battle with the 
intruder team's mascot girl.

00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:34.340
I don't know what's going on, but it's fun!

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:37.850
Oh, you're wonderful, Viking-san!

00:02:38.540 --> 00:02:41.130
<i>Thank goodness he's an idiot.</i>

00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:43.430
<i>I'm counting on you, Suigin.</i>

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:47.520
Ow... Wh-What are you doing?

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:54.810
The pictures... disappeared?

00:02:58.600 --> 00:03:03.610
Do you really think your sis 
will be happy about this?

00:03:06.260 --> 00:03:07.320
Your...

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:12.320
The memories that you two made 
together are going to disappear.

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:21.100
Not just from your heart, 
but from her heart, too.

00:03:26.770 --> 00:03:29.770
But... But...

00:03:30.970 --> 00:03:36.320
There's no other way to cure 
Mikan-neechan's illness!

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:38.320
I don't want this, either!

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:41.440
I don't want our memories 
together to disappear!

00:03:41.960 --> 00:03:44.080
I don't want that!

00:03:44.360 --> 00:03:46.290
I don't want that!

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:51.460
Here.

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:55.420
Th-Thanks.

00:03:55.800 --> 00:03:59.220
But, but...

00:04:01.190 --> 00:04:02.170
It'll be fine.

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:07.850
I'll... I'll switch with you.

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:15.260
Looks like after the intruder team had their 
little break up, they decided to switch out.

00:04:15.260 --> 00:04:17.560
This is also rather unexpected.

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:20.940
The one who switched places 
with him is ID: Riku Suigin.

00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:21.200
Intruder

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:23.280
Riku Suigin

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:23.280
Well, this is a surprise!

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:26.070
He actually hasn't even finished 
the beginner's course!

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:29.330
He is 100% an amateur, 
ladies and gentlemen!

00:04:29.560 --> 00:04:31.720
Nee-san, that's...

00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:32.710
Yeah.

00:04:32.940 --> 00:04:37.200
You're gonna make me fight some amateur 
after making me wait so long?

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:35.860
Thanks!

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:39.490
You mocking me?

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:46.880
If you don't come at me with everything 
you've got, you ain't got no chance!

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:51.940
Riku Suigin, who tagged in, is absolutely 
no match for Viking's power!

00:04:51.940 --> 00:04:53.510
Suigin-niichan!

00:04:53.510 --> 00:04:54.600
Oh, dear.

00:04:55.260 --> 00:04:57.440
Jeez... You're so hopeless.

00:04:58.010 --> 00:04:59.810
Stop moving around so much!

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:02.740
Take this!

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:14.670
Oh, this is Viking's frost attack!

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:19.170
Suigin struggles the best 
he can, but he can't move!

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:25.000
Mammoth Viking moves in on Suigin!

00:05:25.440 --> 00:05:26.940
That's what you get!

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:29.280
Now...

00:05:29.280 --> 00:05:30.760
You're finished!

00:05:36.650 --> 00:05:37.980
Onee-chan?

00:05:38.340 --> 00:05:39.930
Who would've imagined?!

00:05:39.930 --> 00:05:43.250
The mascot girl from the intruder team is 
now participating in the battle as well!

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:46.030
Who knows what'll happen now?

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:45.830
Intruder

00:05:46.460 --> 00:05:47.820
This is...

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:50.330
There's no registration data on her.

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:53.340
Then, could that girl be...

00:05:53.340 --> 00:05:56.350
Thanks for the help, Twin Star.

00:05:56.350 --> 00:05:59.030
You're gonna owe me big for this.

00:05:59.030 --> 00:06:03.090
Well, aren't you a sexy little lady?

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:06.150
I choose you! Tell me your name.

00:06:08.100 --> 00:06:09.850
I wonder if you'll be able to 
say the same thing,

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:15.400
once you see my beautiful, 
yet terrifying, true form...

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:18.760
You're going to reveal yourself?

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:31.790
"Beautiful, yet terrifying"?

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:33.250
No, star!

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:34.910
We made a mistake, twin.

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:37.930
S-So cute!

00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:42.840
So soft! You're just like 
fluffy marshmallows!

00:06:43.440 --> 00:06:46.140
G-Gross, twin!

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:50.640
H-He's a freak...

00:06:51.130 --> 00:06:54.070
Stop it!

00:06:57.270 --> 00:06:58.890
Wh-What'd you do that for?

00:06:58.890 --> 00:06:59.990
Takeshi!

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:03.420
Guys are supposed to protect girls!

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:05.230
And I...

00:07:05.670 --> 00:07:08.240
haven't given up fighting!

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:13.340
I managed to take care of them.

00:07:13.710 --> 00:07:16.800
You okay? You're not hurt, are you?

00:07:20.020 --> 00:07:21.540
What's wrong, Takeshi?

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:24.850
I'm here with you, so there's 
nothing to be scared about.

00:07:28.270 --> 00:07:30.860
Well said, brat!

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:35.600
So hurry up and hand 'em 
over and get outta here!

00:07:39.770 --> 00:07:43.880
I wanted to protect Mikan-neechan forever!

00:07:44.870 --> 00:07:48.900
I'm not gonna run away anymore! 
I won't hide anymore!

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:52.110
It's my turn to protect her!

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:53.740
Takeshi...

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:57.050
Viking is a rather small man, 
despite his size.

00:07:57.050 --> 00:08:00.660
He's beating the little boy from 
the intruder team to a pulp!

00:08:02.860 --> 00:08:05.130
Thanks, Takeshi...

00:08:09.650 --> 00:08:14.040
I'm okay now. Thanks for protecting me.

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:15.330
Huh?

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:17.800
Wow!

00:08:18.190 --> 00:08:20.420
Someone who can freely change 
their physical appearance

00:08:20.420 --> 00:08:23.690
and isn't documented in user records...

00:08:23.950 --> 00:08:26.120
That girl must be...

00:08:26.120 --> 00:08:28.280
A humanoid grave beast.

00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:31.390
Th-This isn't good!

00:08:31.390 --> 00:08:35.530
A humanoid grave beast, who is a 
high-level familiar, has appeared!

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:42.010
Who in the world is this young man who's 
an amateur, yet controls a familiar?

00:08:42.010 --> 00:08:43.420
Well...

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:45.380
Nee-san...

00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:46.280
Yeah.

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:50.180
Are you trying to mess with me?

00:08:50.490 --> 00:08:55.040
You ain't gonna fool me with that bluff.

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:19.290
Th-There it is!

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:22.670
S-Class Grave Beast

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:22.830
A giant two-headed dragon has appeared!

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:22.670
Twin-Headed Jade Dragon

00:09:23.230 --> 00:09:26.040
That's definitely the 
Twin-headed Jade Dragon.

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:28.550
But why does he have it?

00:09:29.050 --> 00:09:30.050
Wow.

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:32.940
Wh-Wh-Wha...

00:09:33.270 --> 00:09:35.420
What the heck is that?!

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:53.350
I-Im... Impossible!

00:09:57.410 --> 00:10:00.320
Winner, the intruder team!

00:10:05.490 --> 00:10:07.710
Thanks, Suigin-niichan!

00:10:08.060 --> 00:10:08.860
Yeah.

00:10:09.230 --> 00:10:11.340
Give my regards to Mikan-neechan.

00:10:11.600 --> 00:10:15.870
Thanks, Dragon Lady. Bye-bye!

00:10:18.210 --> 00:10:20.330
Dragon Lady, huh?

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:24.060
Oh, right.

00:10:24.480 --> 00:10:26.290
<i>Hey, Suigin.</i>

00:10:26.290 --> 00:10:30.140
<i>Are you sure you were okay with giving him 
the prize money and the snow leopard?</i>

00:10:30.510 --> 00:10:35.520
Well, I'm a billion player. 
I don't care about 10 million.

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:39.610
More importantly, why don't 
you put some clothes on?

00:10:39.610 --> 00:10:43.740
<i>I-I can't do anything about this 
until my energy charges back up.</i>

00:10:44.090 --> 00:10:46.430
<i>All that real money...</i>

00:10:46.430 --> 00:10:48.000
<i>Whatever!</i>

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:50.540
O-Oh...

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:53.550
I-It was real money?

00:11:01.820 --> 00:11:05.430
Who could that young man have been?

00:11:05.860 --> 00:11:10.720
Who knows? But the fact that 
he has that grave beast...

00:11:10.720 --> 00:11:13.060
C-Could he be the Collector's...

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:16.550
Shh! Don't say such things.

00:11:16.550 --> 00:11:21.810
The witch that conquered this 
stage all on her own...

00:11:22.930 --> 00:11:26.910
Hopefully nothing bad happens.
